@orc = http://localhost:5401
@applicationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Düşük risk → Approved
POST {{orc}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "amount": 120000, "termMonths": 12 }

### Orta risk, yüksek taksit → Rejected
POST {{orc}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb", "amount": 120000, "termMonths": 12 }

### Orta risk, makul taksit → Approved
POST {{orc}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb", "amount": 36000, "termMonths": 12 }

### Yüksek risk → Rejected
POST {{orc}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "cccccccc-cccc-cccc-cccc-cccccccccccc", "amount": 10000, "termMonths": 12 }

### Bilinmeyen müşteri → SOAP Fault (CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND) → 404 ProblemDetails
POST {{orc}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "dddddddd-dddd-dddd-dddd-dddddddddddd", "amount": 10000, "termMonths": 12 }

### Doğrulama hatası → 400
POST {{orc}}/loan-applications
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa", "amount": 0, "termMonths": 0 }

###
GET {{orc}}/loan-applications

###
GET {{orc}}/loan-applications/{{applicationId}}
